# --- A. Root Ingress (Directed to JELLYFIN) ---
https://waltdakind.xubi.org, https://jellyfin.waltdakind.xubi.org, https://ordinateur.local, https://voltaireun.local, https://voltairedeux.local, https://mediaserver.local, https://192.168.4.30, https://192.168.4.21, https://localhost {
    import custom_tls
    import jellyfin_cluster
}

